#########################################################################
# STRATEGY: catalogue-source-tracked
#
# Unlike the other two variants, this one actually tracks the catalogue
# app source (backend/, frontend/, nginx/, docs/, documents/, tools/) in
# omero-mvls's own git history - a real record of the merged app code as
# it runs on this server, not just the merge documentation.
#
# Generated/data content stays ignored, mirroring the exact exclusions
# mvls-catalogue's own .gitignore already uses for these same
# directories - thumbnails/, manual_thumbnails/, thumbnail_backups/,
# backups/ (contains real password hashes - see the `users` table in
# catalogue/docs/database.md), __pycache__/, *.pyc, *.sql, *.tar.gz,
# *.log, *.working, mvls-catalogue_tree.txt.
#########################################################################

#########################################################################
# Secrets
#########################################################################
.env

#########################################################################
# Certificates - by file type rather than the whole certs/ folder, so
# anything else placed there isn't silently hidden too.
#   *.key - private keys (omero.key, server.key) - real secrets.
#   *.p12 - PKCS12 bundles (server.p12) - embeds the private key.
#   *.pem - certificates/chains (fullchain.pem, server.pem) and DH
#           params (ffdhe2048.pem) - not secret, but generated by
#           certificates.sh / renewed by IT, not source.
#########################################################################
*.key
*.p12
*.pem

# certs/README.md specifically (not certs/ generally - see above) is a
# stale hand-written note that doesn't match the current setup (it
# references "omeroJM.key" instead of the actual "omero.key", and
# describes separate CertFile/KeyFile properties instead of the actual
# single CertFile server.p12 approach extra.omero uses) - excluded so
# it isn't accidentally committed as-is. Superseded by RUNBOOK.md /
# SETUP.md; delete it or bring it up to date before untracking this
# line.
certs/README.md

#########################################################################
# Database backups - Postgres dumps from backup_database.sh at the repo
# root, AND MariaDB dumps from backup_mariadb.sh under
# catalogue/backups/ - this one bare pattern catches both, since
# unprefixed gitignore patterns match at any depth. Both contain real
# user data.
#########################################################################
backups/

#########################################################################
# External OMERO data (bind-mounted from OMEROFILESEXTERNALPATH) - real
# slide/image data, not part of this repo.
#########################################################################
OMERO/

#########################################################################
# Stray manual backup files from hand-editing configs before a change
# (nginx.conf.old, fullchain.pem.old, omero.oldkey, etc.)
#########################################################################
*.old
*.oldkey
*.bak

#########################################################################
# MVLS Catalogue app - tracked here except the generated/data content
# below (same directories mvls-catalogue's own .gitignore excludes).
#########################################################################
catalogue/thumbnails/
catalogue/manual_thumbnails/
catalogue/thumbnail_backups/
catalogue/mvls-catalogue_tree.txt

# Python bytecode (present today: catalogue/backend/app/__pycache__/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated/transient, wherever they show up under catalogue/
*.sql
*.tar.gz
*.log
*.working
